From openbsd-alpha  Mon May 06 22:38:22 2002
From: Miod Vallat <miod () online ! fr>
Date: Mon, 06 May 2002 22:38:22 +0000
To: openbsd-alpha
Subject: Re: console getty
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=openbsd-alpha&m=102072466223676

> With revision 1.11 of src/etc/etc.alpha/ttys, the getty on the
> console serial port of my 164SX has disappeared.
> 
> I don't understand this.

Quick fix: uncomment the tty00 line in /etc/ttys.

Basically, the console getty was switched off to favor ttyC0 for
wsdisplay consoles, so that X could start correctly.

Miod
